#==============================================================================================
#
#   require_trusted_types_for_directive - TrustedTypes::RequireTrustedTypesForDirective: the
#   CSP directive require-trusted-types-for
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/TrustedTypes/RequireTrustedTypesForDirective.cpp lines 26-83:
#       the constructor and the pre-navigation check. Every navigation of a page whose policy
#       has the directive runs the check; it allows any URL that is not a javascript: URL
#       (step 1). A javascript: URL is converted through the Trusted Types default policy, a
#       JS callback (phase 3, steps 2-8 trap where reached).
